    <br />
    <h5>Click on the form number to download a form.  To filter search results, use the "Quick Filter" and type in keyword or 3-digit form number (example: FM-004)</h5>
    <h5>Note to eFilers: To successfully upload court forms into eFileMaine, the user must remove all security settings from the PDF document. Noncompliance will result in submission failure. Instructions for removing form security are available for <a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/ecourts/mac-forms-security.pdf" target="_blank">MAC</a> and <a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/ecourts/pc-forms-security.pdf" target="_blank">PC</a> users on the MJB <a href="https://www.courts.maine.gov/ecourts/efile.html" target="_blank">About eFileMaine page</a> </h5>
    <h5>If you need a form in an alternative format, please reach out to the accessibility office at accessibility@courts.maine.gov or (207) 822-0718.</h5>
    <h5>PLEASE NOTE: If the use of a court form is required the current version <b>must</b> be used. Outdated forms will be returned as incomplete. This site contains the most up-to-date version of all court forms.</h5>
</form>
